      "message": "If you\u0027re going to handle native code in a separate singleton then there is no reason to do this.  Either delte the IDEInfo implementation here, so the java singleton won\u0027t see it at all, or use the java singleton for both by moving it into the android package, renaming the output file to module_bp_deps.json, and making this function collect all the module data into an android.IdeInfo.",
