      "writtenOn": "2019-11-12T05:59:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because we arn\u0027t sure if there contains any native project in the user\u0027s target project, we write this info to module_bp_java_deps.json first. If we check and find there are native projects inside the user\u0027s target project we use \"export SOONG_COLLECT_CC_DEPS\u003dtrue\" command to generate module_bp_cc_deps.json to get the native\u0027s info and create CMakeLists.txt project files. Otherwise we don\u0027t have to generate module_bp_cc_deps.json file.",
      "parentUuid": "397ca8c8_23801503",
      "revId": "443064ae4d1464761e24846a66690487703d21ef",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
